  "dct_description_sm": [
    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us7000pa9d](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us7000pa9d) Magnitude 5.8 earthquake at 68.595 depth occurred on Jan 31 2025 19km SW of Tapaktuan. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude 3.1766 longitude 97.0339. It impacted 110113 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
